This repository contains project code, evaluation artifacts, examples, and a LoRA adapter for organic chemical structure recognition with PaddleOCR-VL-1.5.

The PaddleOCR-VL-1.5 base model is not included. Users must obtain the base model separately and comply with its license and usage terms.

The included LoRA adapter is intended to be loaded together with PaddleOCR-VL-1.5.

